#. module: woow_ai_task_crm
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_ai_task_crm/models/crm_lead.py:0
msgid ""
"Default Access Rights (Settings > Users) is on: new employees get the "
"default user template's groups, with Odoo's template Sales Administrator too"
" (they read every lead)."
msgstr "「預設存取權限」（設定 > 使用者）開著：新員工會拿到預設使用者範本的群組，Odoo 的範本也包括「銷售：管理員」（讀得到每一筆商機）。"

#. module: woow_ai_task_crm
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_ai_task_crm/models/crm_lead.py:0
msgid ""
"Employees who read every lead (Sales: \"All Documents\" or Administrator), "
"and so may use the consultation chats of every lead: %(readers)s of "
"%(employees)s."
msgstr ""
"讀得到每一筆商機的員工（銷售「使用者: 所有文件」或「管理員」），也就是能用每一筆商機的顧問對話的人：%(employees)s 位中有 "
"%(readers)s 位。"

