#. module: woow_ai_task_crm
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_ai_task_crm.field_crm_lead__woow_project_ai_consult_enabled
msgid ""
"The AI consultant is enabled for this kind of record and you have the user "
"rights of the Project app."
msgstr "這類紀錄已開啟 AI 顧問，而且你有「專案」的使用者權限。"

#. module: woow_ai_task_crm
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_ai_task_crm.field_project_task__woow_project_ai_consult_lead_id
msgid ""
"The lead or opportunity this consultation task is about (set by \"Ask the AI"
" Consultant\"). Only people who can read it may use the task's AI chats once"
" the CRM consultant is enabled."
msgstr "這張顧問任務諮詢的潛在商機或商機（由「詢問 AI 顧問」設定）。CRM 的 AI 顧問開啟後，只有讀得到它的人才能使用任務的 AI 對話。"

#. module: woow_ai_task_crm
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_ai_task_crm/models/crm_lead.py:0
msgid ""
"Visitors type leads' names, company names and campaign, source and medium "
"names too (web forms, Live Chat): e-mail addresses, phone numbers and IP "
"addresses in them are masked by patterns, which is not a guarantee; names "
"and postal addresses are not masked."
msgstr ""
"商機名稱、公司名稱和行銷活動、來源、媒介名稱也可能是訪客打的（網站表單、Live Chat）：裡面的電子郵件、電話號碼和 IP "
"位址會用比對規則遮蔽，這不是保證；人名和地址不會遮蔽。"
